EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Doesn't today feel {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}kinda special?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}That's 'cause it's February 29th!
Leap years always feel special!{{TAG:0009:0001:020003000400}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Oggi non ti pare che sia, cioè,
{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}speciale?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Perché è il 29 febbraio!
Gli anni bisestili sono
troppo speciali!{{TAG:0009:0001:020003000400}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Bugün sana da {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}biraz özel gelmiyor mu?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Çünkü bugün 29 Şubat! Artık yıllar
hep ekstra özel geliyor!{{TAG:0009:0001:020003000400}}

{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Dört yılda bir gelen süper özel bir gün!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0005:}}
Bugün {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}dört yıldır eğlenmemişim gibi
partinin dibine vuracağım, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Artık yılın {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}sadece dört yılda bir
geldiğine inanabiliyor musun? {{TAG:0003:001D:}}Bu, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}yani,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
resmen kutlama sebebi!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}We only get one February 29th
every 4 years, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}so {{TAG:0003:001D:}}let's make this
leap year {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}a really special one!{{TAG:0009:0000:06000700}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Solo tenemos 29 de febrero una
vez cada cuatro años, en los años
bisiestos, ¿sabes?{{TAG:0009:0000:06000700}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Abbiamo un 29 febbraio solo
una volta ogni quattro anni, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}quindi
{{TAG:0003:001D:}}dobbiamo festeggiare {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}alla grande!{{TAG:0009:0000:06000700}}

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Den 29. Februar gibt's nur alle vier
Jahre! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:001D:}}Lass uns dieses Schaltjahr
also zu etwas Besonderem machen!{{TAG:0009:0000:06000700}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Dört yılda yalnız bir 29 Şubat var, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}o yüzden{{TAG:0003:001D:}}
bu artık yılı {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}unutulmayacak kadar özel
yapalım!{{TAG:0009:0000:06000700}}

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Thanks to leap year, we get an
extra day this February! {{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}Like,{{TAG:0003:0003:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
that's a total bonus, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Grazie all'anno bisestile, abbiamo
un giorno in più a febbraio! {{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}Sembra{{TAG:0003:0003:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
un regalo, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!
